ml_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-15T22:21:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T02:43:28Z","closed_at":"2025-12-03T02:43:26Z","assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in `master` after 3c1e4792909fbaff63e2437f1c06029bd1aa507f\n- NOT reproducible in Godot 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nMeta Quest 3 - Android - Qualcomm XR2 gen2\n\nAlso reproducible on Samsung Galaxy XR with Qualcomm XR2+ gen2 (<-- the extra plus)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith foveated rendering enabled in the Vulkan Mobile renderer, there is a sort of \"insect eye\" or \"kaleidoscope\" thing happening in the right eye:\n\n<img width=\"743\" height=\"770\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6ef73e3-295e-410c-af0e-8b248b9f6930\" />\n\nThe above image was captured in RenderDoc. In the background the the view looks more-or-less correct, but then there are 6 smaller views of different subsets of the scene shown along the left and right edges.\n\nThis is a regression caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110077\n\n@clayjohn spent some time looking into it, and it appears to be a driver bug that is triggered by the use of spec constants in this particular case. With some modifications, he found that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111452 would fix it (I think because it optimizes away the spec constants)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWith an XR project using the Vulkan Mobile renderer, you only need to ensure that foveated rendering is enabled by:\n\n- Setting \"XR\" -> \"OpenXR\" -> \"Foveation Level\" to \"High\" (or any other value aside from \"Off\")\n- Setting \"Rendering\" -> \"VRS\" -> \"Mode\" to \"XR\"\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis isn't exactly an MRP (because it isn't minimal), but the issue is apparent if you take this project and switch the renderer to \"Mobile\" (it's set to \"Compatibility\" in the repo):\n\nhttps://github.com/dsnopek/gdquest-tps-demo/tree/standalone-vr-benchmark\n\n(Note: the branch is `standalone-vr-benchmark`)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112834/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112834/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}